{
 "id": 382664,
 "name": "Part 2: Update Salesforce lead status by Lead ID",
 "description": "1. Workbot will monitor the Slack channel and activate every time a Salesforce Lead URL is mentioned. \n2. Workbot will search Salesforce for the Lead and post the details. \n3. Workbot will prompt you with a button to change the Lead status. \n4. Change the Lead status from within Slack with Workbot. Possible Lead statuses are: Open - Not Contacted, Working - Contacted, Closed - Converted, Closed - Not Converted\n5. This recipe update the Lead with the new status.\n\n**Notes**\n- This recipe works together with the [Slack Workbot shows Salesforce Lead details when you post a URL in Slack](https://www.workato.com/recipes/382651-slack-workbot-shows-salesforce-lead-details-when-you-post-a-url-in-slack#recipe) recipe. To use this recipe, copy and run both recipes.\n- Workbot must be invited to Slack channels before it can post messages in those channels.\n\n",
 "applications": [
  "slack_bot",
  "salesforce",
  "slack_bot"
 ],
